OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree stalemate continues as
OL,4,Aprotesters remain overnight
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters remained on the Garvaghy
OL,7,FRoad overnight as the Drumcree parade
OL,8,Fdispute continues.
OL,10,FThe main parties involved in the
OL,11,Fdispute in Northern Ireland are still
OL,12,Fin a stalemate, following a day of
OL,13,Fpolitical talks and heated exchanges at
OL,14,FStormont.
OL,16,FTalks to resolve the issue took place
OL,17,Fon Monday as members of the Orange
OL,18,FOrder waited to begin their permitted
OL,19,Fparade, which was due to take place on
OL,20,FSunday morning, and walk down the
OL,21,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,22,FPortadown.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
